<% page_title "Find the rare thing you've been looking for" %>

<section class="hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">Your personal hunter</span>
  <h1>The rare piece you've been hunting for. Found for you.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Tell Grail Hunter what you're after: the brand, the model, the year, your size and your budget.
    We keep checking the marketplaces and only show you the listings worth your time.
  </p>
  <div class="actions">
    <%= link_to "Start hunting", new_registration_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    <%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path, class: "btn" %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="steps" id="how">
  <div class="card step">
    <div class="icon">1</div>
    <h3>Describe it</h3>
    <p class="muted">A 90s Patagonia Snap-T in medium under $150. A Seiko Pogue, serviced. A Leica M6, not the TTL. Be as particular as you like.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card step">
    <div class="icon">2</div>
    <h3>We hunt</h3>
    <p class="muted">We search the marketplaces, read every listing, and check size, condition and price against what you asked for. Replicas and wrong sizes get flagged.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card step">
    <div class="icon">3</div>
    <h3>You decide</h3>
    <p class="muted">Matches arrive ranked, with a plain explanation of why. Save the ones you like, pass on the rest, and we'll keep looking.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="pricing">
  <span class="label">Pricing</span>
  <h2>Pay per check, or subscribe and let us check every day.</h2>
  <p class="muted">Every plan hunts the same way. A subscription lowers the price of each check and lets us look daily or hourly instead of weekly.</p>
  <div class="plans">
    <% @plans.each do |plan| %>
      <%= render "billings/plan_card", plan: plan, current: false, signed_in: false %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>
